hifiberry-librespot (0.8.0.4) stable; urgency=medium

  * start-librespot: expose librespot's volume curve via a VOLUME_CTRL
    environment variable (linear|log|cubic|fixed). Default stays "linear"
    so behaviour is unchanged; integrators can pick a cubic curve (closer to
    shairport-sync's "standard" profile) via a systemd drop-in without
    forking the wrapper. (start-librespot.sh v1.1.2; GH issue #8,
    mattias-arrelid)

